ADDENDA <Act No. 18630, Dec. 21, 2021>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force six months after the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Applicability to incorporation of corporation and implementation of projects)
The amended provisions of Article 11-2 shall begin to apply to the cases where urban development zones are designated after this Act enters into force.
Article 3 (Applicability to selection of private-sector participants)
Notwithstanding Article 2, where a person specified in Article 11(1) 1 through 4 has selected private-sector participants by means of public invitation to establish a corporation referred to in Article 11(1)11 as at the time this Act is promulgated (limited to the cases where the public invitation was publicly announced and the results of the public invitation have been notified by means of public announcement or official document), the amended provisions of Article 11-2(2) and (7) concerning the selection of private-sector participants shall begin to apply to the first cases where urban development zones are designated after the lapse of three years from the enforcement date of this Act. In such cases, an agreement for the implementation of project shall be concluded pursuant to the amended provisions of Article 11-2(1) and (3) through (7) (the same shall also apply where such agreement is already concluded before the date of promulgation of this Act).
[Previous Article 3 moved to Article 4 <Jul. 18, 2023>]
Article 4 (Applicability to supply plans of developed land)
The amended provisions of Article 26 shall begin to apply the cases where supply plans are formulated after this Act enters into force; provided, the amended provisions of the proviso of Article 26(3) shall begin to apply to the cases where urban development zones are designated after this Act enters into force.
[Moved from Article 3; previous Article 4 moved to Article 5 <Jul. 18, 2023>]
Article 5 (Applicability to supply prices of school sites)
The amended provisions of Article 27-1 shall begin to apply to the cases where urban development zones are designated after this Act enters into force.
[Moved from Article 4 <Jul. 18, 2023>]

